a@quartzventures.test","side":"customer"}],"cc":[],"subject":"Anything I can help with?","body":"Hi Ana,\n\nGood to see Quartz Ventures has a real project going. Let me know if you want a second pair of eyes on how it's structured.\n\nBest,\nNadia Goldberg","threadId":"c42e7a24-9f30-4c8c-a1be-52ea164b28e5"},{"id":"731cd631-f8e3-408c-8ecd-c72964c062f5","at":"2026-07-20T17:57:00.000Z","channel":"email","from":{"name":"Elena Kelly","address":"elena@wrenfield.test","side":"staff"},"to":[{"name":"Ana","address":"ana@quartzventures.test","side":"customer"}],"cc":[],"subject":"Get your team moving with Wrenfield","body":"Hi Ana,\n\nA quick nudge: Wrenfield works best once your team's actual tasks are in it. If you've been meaning to set that up, today's as good a day as any.\n\nWarmly,\nElena Kelly","threadId":"1c93b3af-a226-4336-af4b-00d7834bd998"},{"id":"ad246f85-b61c-4d44-8fa4-1fb325a795b6","at":"2026-07-17T22:12:38.574Z","channel":"slack","slackChannel":"#new-signups","author":{"name":"Signup bot","address":null,"side":"bot"},"text":"New signup alert -- *Quartz Ventures* just created a workspace on pro.","inThread":false},{"id":"75f21a8e-edbe-4b38-b0c6-8f50f009bdcc","at":"2026-07-17T22:11:38.669Z","channel":"email","from":{"name":"Nadia Goldberg","address":"nadia@wrenfield.test","side":"staff"},"to":[{"name":"Ana","address":"ana@quartzventures.test","side":"customer"}],"cc":[],"subject":"Getting started with Wrenfield","body":"Hi Ana,\n\nThanks for setting up Quartz Ventures on Wrenfield. If your team is more than one person, inviting them now tends to pay off -- Wrenfield is built around teammates working on shared tasks, not solo lists.\n\nLet me know how the first week goes.\n\nBest,\nNadia Goldberg","threadId":"dbe38fd6-2941-47c4-9f74-0b3897178e63"},{"id":"b876dae8-37de-4a37-8f51-00347fff5980","at":"2026-07-17T22:04:38.669Z","channel":"product","event":"first_project","actor":{"name":"Ana","address":"ana@quartzventures.test","side":"customer"}},{"id":"a9909f29-9483-4037-9d30-bea6ffbf3917","at":"2026-07-17T22:04:38.669Z","channel":"account","name":"Quartz Ventures"},{"id":"96d55ac4-8d9e-499c-9f04-c04a90a29e11","at":"2026-07-17T22:04:38.669Z","channel":"product","event":"signup","actor":{"name":"Ana","address":"ana@quartzventures.test","side":"customer"}},{"id":"49efc348-9b83-47d6-ad1b-c072213325d8","at":"2026-07-17T22:04:38.669Z","channel":"billing","plan":"pro","status":"active","canceledAt":null}],"decisions":[{"id":"fa73fb18-5cb7-45ab-a928-bd366f2911c0","kind":"scheduled","evaluatedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:00.000Z","rawP":0.42,"calibratedP":0.48637789352718175,"calibratedSource":"stored","rationale":"Ana replied positively and stated intent to add the team (email:93d733ce), and a first project exists (reached day 0), so engagement is real. But no invite sent in 6 days, she no-showed the onboarding call (calendar:819ce40c), and two nudges (email:708be590, 9b243fd1) produced only intent. 8 days left.","draft":{"from":"nadia@wrenfield.test","to":"ana@quartzventures.test","subject":"Re: Anything I can help with?","body":"Hi Ana,\n\nThanks for the reply — glad Wrenfield is landing well so far, and getting the rest of the team in is a good next step. A teammate can be invited from Account Settings -> Members at any time, and teammates can be bulk-invited from a CSV file instead of one at a time if that's easier for the whole group.\n\nSorry we missed each other last week. Want me to walk through adding the team with you on a short call this week? Happy to work around your schedule.\n\nBest,\nNadia"},"actionId":"ac25ca3f-8cc4-4243-9cfc-3feb738a354e","evidenceRefs":["a9909f29-9483-4037-9d30-bea6ffbf3917","49efc348-9b83-47d6-ad1b-c072213325d8","b876dae8-37de-4a37-8f51-00347fff5980","9938d66d-83c6-4c4d-8807-8dd1d18dbf42","ff44877f-dfb0-4f10-9f86-088d5d588626","eaaa36e0-cd3a-4a07-aa23-16c50a52724e","731cd631-f8e3-408c-8ecd-c72964c062f5","75f21a8e-edbe-4b38-b0c6-8f50f009bdcc"],"refs":{"email:0339f638":"75f21a8e-edbe-4b38-b0c6-8f50f009bdcc